 "remarks": "Welcome to 50 Creeping Hemlock Drive, Norwalk, CT a wonderful opportunity to enjoy comfort, versatility, and a convenient location all in one! This inviting home offers a functional layout with plenty of space to fit today's lifestyle. A standout feature is the finished basement, providing valuable additional living space with exciting possibilities. Create an in-law-style setup, guest space, home office, recreation room, media room, or the ultimate entertainment area the choice is yours!  Conveniently located near shopping, dining, schools, parks, major roadways, and everyday amenities, this home makes it easy to enjoy everything Norwalk and the surrounding area have to offer. Whether you're looking for extra room for extended family, work-from-home flexibility, or simply more space to relax and entertain, 50 Creeping Hemlock Drive is ready to welcome you home. Schedule your private showing and discover the possibilities!",
